// Gives JobScheduler idle windows on this head unit. On automotive builds CarIdlenessTracker only reports idle
// during Garage Mode, when forced, or on ACTION_TRIGGER_IDLE while the screen is off. This board rarely sees Garage
// Mode (no ignition-off on the desk, power is cut instead), so idle jobs never ran: Play's auto-updates and
// "garage mode installs" of the preinstalled Google apps (GMS stayed at the image version), plus other idle
// maintenance. Sends ACTION_TRIGGER_IDLE after the screen has been off for a while; screen-on ends idle again.
// Runs persistent as system uid (the broadcast is protected).
android_app {
    name: "IdleMaintenance",
    srcs: ["src/**/*.java"],
    manifest: "AndroidManifest.xml",
    platform_apis: true,
    certificate: "platform",
}
